@startuml building-block-view
' Rendered with PlantUML's built-in Smetana layout (pure Java) so the SVG export
' needs no external Graphviz/dot install — reproducible in CI and on any machine.
!pragma layout smetana
' arc42 §5 — Building Block View (Level 1 whitebox) of the SteuerEule system.
' Source of record for the diagram; export to building-block-view.svg (see README).
' Highlighted (green) = building blocks added since this view's previous revision
' (REQ-001, the Cockpit vertical): Slice 2's auth stack (REQ-005/006/008/009/010,
' ADR-0009/0012) and REQ-011's DSGVO export/deletion (ADR-0013).
' Keep this in step with the code — a stale arc42 is treated as a failing test.
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam packageBorderColor #6b7280

title SteuerEule — Building Block View (Level 1) · arc42 §5\ngreen = added since the REQ-001 revision (Slice 2 auth · REQ-011 DSGVO)

actor "User\n(guest session or\nverified account)" as user

package "apps/mobile-web  ·  Expo / React-Native-Web" as fe {
  component "SplashScreen" as splash
  component "LoginScreen · RegistrierungScreen\nemail/password · guest · Google" as login #palegreen
  component "OnboardingScreen" as onb
  component "CockpitScreen\n(hero estimate card,\nhonest states)" as cockpitScreen
  component "ProfilScreen\n(view/edit stored profile)" as profilScreen #palegreen
  component "DatenschutzScreen\nDSGVO export + deletion" as datenschutzScreen #palegreen
  component "AuthClientProvider\nthe one better-auth client\n(session · sign-in/up/out)" as authClient #palegreen
  component "exportDownload.ts\nthe one documented egress\noutside the generated client" as exportDl #palegreen
}

package "Shared packages (monorepo)" as pkgs {
  component "@steuereule/core\ndeterministic domain —\nvalidators · cockpitRange()" as core
  component "@steuereule/api-client\norval-generated typed client\n+ TanStack Query hooks\nprofile · cockpit · auth · account" as apiclient
  component "@steuereule/ui\nFunke design system" as ui
  component "@steuereule/tokens\ndesign tokens" as tokens
}

package "apps/api  ·  NestJS on Fastify" as api {
  component "better-auth\nFastify catch-all on /api/auth/*\n(mounted outside Nest)" as betterauth #palegreen
  component "UserContextGuard\nidentity seam (ADR-0007/0012):\nverified session OR signed guest cookie" as guard
  component "AuthModule\ncapabilities · guest→account upgrade\nFreshAuthChecker · breach-check\nEmailSender seam" as authMod #palegreen
  component "ProfileModule\nGET/PUT /v1/profile" as profile
  component "CockpitModule\nGET /v1/steuerjahre/{jahr}/cockpit" as cockpitMod
  component "AccountModule\nGET /v1/account/export (JSON · PDF)\nDELETE /v1/account (teardown txn)\nPdfRenderer seam" as accountMod #palegreen
  component "AuditModule\nTaxDataAccessLog (append-only)" as audit
  component "PrismaModule\nfield-encrypted Prisma client" as prisma
  component "Cross-cutting\nCORS allowlist (ADR-0011) ·\nhelmet/CSP · DB-backed rate limits" as crosscut #palegreen
}

database "Postgres (EU)\nexpand-only migrations (ADR-047)" as db {
  component "Profile" as tProfile
  component "TaxDataAccessLog" as tAudit
  component "TaxYear" as tTaxYear
  component "User · Session ·\nAccount · Verification\n(better-auth)" as tAuth #palegreen
  component "LegalHold · RateLimit" as tHold #palegreen
}

user --> fe
splash ..> login
login ..> authClient
login ..> apiclient : useAuthCapabilities…\n(is Google actually configured?)
onb ..> apiclient
cockpitScreen ..> apiclient : useCockpit…GetCockpitSummary
cockpitScreen ..> core : formatEuroRange()
profilScreen ..> apiclient : useProfile…Get / Put
profilScreen ..> core : isValidSteuerId()
datenschutzScreen ..> apiclient : useAccountDeletion…DeleteAccount
datenschutzScreen ..> authClient : useSession()\nguest vs. account
datenschutzScreen ..> exportDl : runExport(json | pdf)
fe --> ui
ui ..> tokens

authClient ..> betterauth : HTTP  /api/auth/*  (credentialed)
apiclient ..> api : HTTP  /v1/*  (cookie-scoped)
exportDl ..> api : HTTP  GET /v1/account/export\n(credentialed, binary attachment)

betterauth --> prisma
guard ..> betterauth : resolves the session
guard --> profile
guard --> cockpitMod
guard --> accountMod
authMod --> betterauth
profile --> prisma
profile --> audit
cockpitMod ..> core : cockpitRange()\n(determinism boundary,\nADR-014/048)
cockpitMod --> prisma
accountMod ..> profile : reuses ProfileRepository\n(one decrypt path)
accountMod --> audit
accountMod ..> authMod : FreshAuthChecker\n(fresh session or password)
accountMod --> prisma
audit --> prisma
prisma --> db
crosscut ..> api

note bottom of exportDl
  The **one** sanctioned exception to "all /v1 traffic goes through
  @steuereule/api-client's httpClient mutator" (ADR-0001): the export
  is a `Content-Disposition: attachment` body — JSON *or* PDF bytes —
  and the mutator unconditionally JSON.parse()s. It reuses the same
  configured origin and the same `credentials: 'include'` discipline,
  and it is drawn here rather than hidden inside the screen precisely
  because an undrawn second egress is how "one call site" quietly
  stops being true.
end note

note right of accountMod
  Deletion is **one Prisma $transaction** (ADR-0013 §3):
  hard-delete Profile · anonymise the audit rows to an
  irreversible tombstone (the Art. 30 record survives, the
  person-link does not) · delete the better-auth User
  (Session/Account cascade). Rows under an active LegalHold
  are exempt. All-or-nothing, never a partial teardown.
end note

legend right
  All /v1 access is scoped by the trusted userId the UserContextGuard
  establishes (ADR-0007/0012) — a verified better-auth session or an
  HMAC-signed guest cookie, never a client-supplied identity.
  better-auth (ADR-0009) mounts *behind* that seam, not around it.
  @steuereule/core is the single home of deterministic rules
  (validators, cockpitRange), imported by both api and frontend.
endlegend

@enduml
